# Play test of Keeper's Light (CIPlay keepers_light, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the jetty east of
# the landing stack (deck 1.8 m), its stair up to the deck on the stack's top (7.75 m); the bridge south-west to the
# cottage stack (9.8 m: the cottage, its door to the east), the bridge north to the light stack (8.5 m: the tower, its
# ladder on the south side, the gallery at 26 m; the oil store's door south, by the bridge's end); the stair from the
# cottage stack south down onto the cistern's slab (3.96 m), the hatch at 7.9 -18.75 (the water 7 m deep under it).
island Keeper's Light
offset 1.2994 -2.9908
expect step 0
expect title The Dark Light
wait 5

# Tied up at the jetty: the box by the stair, up the two flights onto the landing stack
walk 22.7 -15 to 21.6 -9.6 h=1.8
reach Landing box
open Landing box
walk 21.6 -9.6 to 22.75 -7 to 22.75 6.6 to 21.5 9 to 17 8.5 h=7.75
zone landing
expect step 1

# Over the south-west bridge to the cottage: the head keeper's diary on the table, the cupboard
walk 17 8.5 to 13.83 8.92 to 6.49 -3.36 to 4.4 -2.85 h=9.85
read Head Keeper Shale's diary
expect step 2
walk 4.4 -2.85 to 4.6 -0.9 h=9.85 below=12
reach Cottage cupboard
open Cottage cupboard

# Back over the landing stack and north over the other bridge to the light: the assistant keeper's diary in the oil store
walk 4.6 -0.9 to 4.4 -2.85 to 6.49 -3.36 to 13.83 8.92 to 17.75 11 to 17.75 22.2 to 17.15 24.4 h=8.55 below=12
reach Oil store crate
open Oil store crate
read Keeper Lusk's diary
expect step 3

# Up the lighthouse's ladders to the gallery: the screechers driven off; the lamp is dry, the horn and the locker wait
walk 17.15 24.4 to 17.15 22.6 to 14.3 22.6 h=8.5 below=11
climb 14.3 23.1 h=8.5
climb 14.3 23.1 h=14.5
climb 14.3 23.1 h=20.5
expect stand 13.6 24.6 h=26.03 below=28
zone lamptop
kill Screecher
expect step 4
use lamp
expect message bone dry
use foghorn
expect message Light the lamp first
open Lamp room locker
expect message wired to the foghorn
expect step 4

# Down to the cistern: back over the bridges, round the cottage, down the stair onto the slab, in at the hatch - the thing
# comes up; the oil at the bottom; up the ladder again
walk 17.75 22.2 to 17.75 11 to 13.83 8.92 to 6.49 -3.36 to 6.9 -6.4 to 3.55 -6.7 to 3.55 -8.3 to 3.55 -13.9 to 3.55 -19.6 to 6.4 -19.4 h=3.96
zone cistern
kill Angler fish
expect step 5
open Iron oil box
expect story lampoil 1
climb 7.9 -18.1 h=-2
expect stand 6.4 -19.4 h=3.96

# Back up to the light with the oil: the lamp, the foghorn, the locker
walk 6.4 -19.4 to 4.9 -21.3 to 3.55 -21.0 to 3.55 -13.9 to 3.55 -8.3 to 3.55 -6.7 to 6.9 -6.4 to 6.49 -3.36 to 13.83 8.92 to 17.75 11 to 17.75 22.2 to 14.3 22.6 h=8.5
climb 14.3 23.1 h=8.5
use lamp
expect message glugs in
expect story lampoil 0
expect shown lamplight
expect shown beam
use foghorn
expect message rolls out over the fog
open Lamp room locker
wait 2
expect item Blueprint_HeadLight 1
expect done

# The supply boat's barrel under the light stack
open Supply boat's barrel
